  "details": "Sometimes can be useful to have more control over where the Result Transform will rest when hit is not detected.\n\nFor this would be great to have selectable options Snap To Ratio and Snap To Distance for Behavior On Miss, that will snap the Result Transform to specified ratio or distance. The ratio and distance should work the same way they are already used for Parameters.\n\nThese options can help create some systems in more optimized way. To achieve this in current state would require usage of parameters and animator logic to detect miss and do appropriate animations to move the result transform to desired position.",
